# JRY Rentals platform

- Stack is Nuxt 3, Vue 3, TypeScript, Nuxt UI, Tailwind, and Supabase. Do not introduce React.
- Follow Controller → Service/Action → Repository → Supabase. Keep pages and components free of pricing, availability, and payment rules.
- Public APIs and URLs use `uuid` or `code` only. Never expose database primary keys.
- Never send service-role keys, SMTP passwords, payment secrets, or cron secrets to the browser.
- Authorize on the server and with RLS. Do not trust role values from the client.
- Default currency is PHP. Default timezone is Asia/Manila. Store timestamps in UTC.
- Preserve existing business rules unless the request changes them.
- Implement one documented phase at a time. Keep the app runnable after every phase.
- Update `/docs` when architecture, schema, API, or security changes.
